From e31c37ba90de3426468686bd59a26b86d56d4217 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HalalifyMusic <244228683+HalalifyMusic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 07:40:10 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] fix(claude): bound plugin UI memory and ignore replaced
 queries

- Each subscriber now gets a one-slot change signal and reads the current
  snapshot, so a slow client holds one pending signal instead of every
  snapshot published (was an unbounded PubSub).
- ingest takes the sending query's identity and drops UI from a query
  that has been replaced, as renders already did.
- Detached, idle thread entries are removed.

