From 589616afd4994c426ed536018645d1404beaa9ad Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: HalalifyMusic <244228683+HalalifyMusic@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 20:35:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] feat(claude): draw plugin Svg elements and join as a
 desktop surface

Svg elements draw as images (a data: URL), which never run scripts. On attach the server sends ui_attach as a desktop surface, so plugins that wait for one (session.attach, $.session.surfaces()) draw right away instead of on their own timer. Verified with centminmod's desktop-statusline: its band with Svg meters arrives about 5.6 s after a cold Claude start.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
